    "id": "WawgQpPNhtk",
    "title": "10 in 10 Podcast Featuring Peter Rivera \"Pete the Peptide Guy\" | Weight Loss, Recovery & Health",
    "guest": "Peter Rivera",
    "publishedAt": "2026-04-02T23:41:40Z",
    "duration": "11:23",
    "description": "In this episode, Pete, better known as “Pete the Peptide Guy,” takes the hot seat to talk about how he built a recognizable brand and became a trusted voice in the growing world of peptides and biohacking.\n\nWhat started as a simple phrase on social media quickly turned into a personal brand that stuck. Pete shares how leaning into a niche helped him stand out in a space filled with noise and misinformation. By focusing on education and consistency, he has built credibility as a specialist in peptides and health optimization.\n\nWith over 30 years in fitness and a background in biology, Pete brings both experience and science into the conversation. He explains how his early approach to health was rooted in traditional methods—long hours in the gym, heavy cardio, and strict calorie control—before discovering more efficient and effective ways to support the body.\n\nHis personal journey shifted after experiencing injuries and health challenges, including a partially torn Achilles tendon and insulin resistance. Through peptides and targeted health strategies, he saw significant improvements, including faster recovery, weight loss, and better overall performance. He shares how tools like peptides, combined with proper nutrition and fitness, can work together to support long-term health.\n\nPete also breaks down how peptides have evolved over time, why they are becoming more mainstream, and the importance of education when navigating this space. His mission is simple: to help people improve their healthspan through informed decisions, science-backed strategies, and practical guidance.\n\nThis episode is a strong introduction to peptides, biohacking, and what is possible when you take a more intentional approach to your health. Whether you are new to the concept or looking to better understand how peptides fit into a wellness routine, this conversation offers clarity and insight from someone deeply immersed in the field.\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others. \n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
