    "description": "Is your home environment making you sick? In this episode of The 10 in 10 Podcast, host Pete the Peptide Guy sits down with environmental wellness expert Leia Ryan to discuss the critical importance of clean air and pure water. Leia shares her deeply personal journey of how optimizing her husband’s surroundings, specifically air quality and water purity, helped him thrive for 13 years following a terminal stage 4 diagnosis.\n\nWe explore the hidden dangers of tap water, why skin absorption of chemicals during a shower is a major health risk, and the science behind hydrogen water. Leia explains the difference between \"passive\" HEPA filters and \"active\" purification technology used in hospital ICUs to kill viruses on surfaces and in the air. Whether you're dealing with allergies, mold, or just want to biohack your home for longevity, this interview provides the roadmap to a non-toxic lifestyle.\n\nCheck Your Water Quality: Type your zip code into the EWG database: https://ewg.org\n\nConnect with The Podcast Lane:\nSubscribe for more health, innovation, and community stories.\n\n00:00 Introduction: Pete the Peptide Guy & Leia Ryan\n00:27 The 13-Year Miracle: A Mission for Clean Air\n01:25 Why Your Surroundings are \"Health Insurance\"\n02:10 Is Your Tap Water Safe? (EWG.org Zip Code Check)\n02:50 Skin Absorption: The Danger of Chemical Showers\n03:33 Hydrogen Water Science: Parts Per Billion vs. Million\n04:30 Active vs. Passive Air Purification Explained\n05:42 Hospital Grade: Reducing Infectious Disease in ICUs\n07:05 Pet Wellness: Keeping Your Dogs & Cats Healthy\n08:25 Travel Tips: Clean Air for Planes, Ubers, and Hotels\n09:20 How to Access Specials & Coupon Codes\n\nCheck Your Zip Code Here: https://ewg.org\nGet Exclusive Discounts: Visit https://safeairtoday.com and use code \"Peptide Pete\" at checkout!\n\n\nFor more information: \nhttps://www.elevateenvironment.com \nAir purification ionized/ hydrogen \nLivingWater| Chemical free LaundryPure \n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time\n\nThis video covers essential health topics including:\n\nHow to check your local tap water quality using the EWG zip code database.\n\nThe benefits of molecular hydrogen water for cellular hydration.\n\nWhy active air purification is superior to traditional passive air filters.\n\nReducing VOCs, mold, and airborne viruses in your home and office.\n\nEnvironmental wellness for pets: Keeping your dogs and cats safe from household toxins.\n\nPortable air purifiers for travel: Staying healthy on planes, in Ubers, and hotel rooms.\n\nThe role of ActivePure technology in reducing infectious diseases in hospitals.\n\nHolistic health insurance: Preventing illness by controlling your environment.",
