    "description": "In this episode of The 10 in 10 Podcast, listeners meet Treasure Milinovich, founder of The Space, a community-centered sanctuary devoted to embodied spirituality, healing, and remembrance.\n\nTreasure shares a defining moment in her personal journey that reshaped her understanding of spirituality and ultimately led to the creation of The Space and the work she offers today. She reflects on how true spiritual awakening often unfolds not through thought alone, but through presence, embodiment, and lived experience.\n\nThe conversation explores how practices such as movement, breathwork, Reiki, and sound reach places that talk-based or purely mental approaches often cannot—helping individuals reconnect with their bodies, regulate their nervous systems, and access deeper clarity and trust.\n\nTreasure also shares what she hopes people experience when working with her or listening to The Space Between, a new podcast launching March 2026. At its core, her work invites a remembering—of inner wisdom, alignment, and the unseen threads that quietly weave us together.\n\nThis episode offers a grounded, spacious perspective on spirituality for those seeking depth, connection, and a more embodied way of living awake.\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
