    "duration": "12:01",
    "description": "In this special episode of The 10 in 10 Podcast, Bill McCartney returns—this time as host—to interview seasoned real estate professional Jay Jasper, a name synonymous with experience, integrity, and results.\n\nWith nearly 40 years in the real estate business and more than 1,500 successful transactions, Jay brings a depth of knowledge that can only be earned through decades of hands-on work. As one recent client—a global CEO and $3,000,000 Valley homebuyer—put it, Jay is “a very smart realtor, mature but not senile.” Jay proudly takes that as a compliment.\n\nThe conversation highlights what sets Jay apart in today’s evolving real estate market: an intimate understanding of neighborhoods, up-to-the-minute market trends, and a reputation built on trust. Clients consistently describe him as trustworthy, honorable, loyal, determined, dedicated, and politely persistent—a seasoned negotiator who tells the truth even when it’s not easy.\n\nJay also shares his personal brand, #ORANGEISTRUTH, reflects both his high-energy approach and his commitment to transparency—qualities that have defined his career for decades.\n\nThis episode is a must-listen for buyers, sellers, and professionals who believe experience, integrity, and truth still matter in real estate.\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
