    "description": "Stop losing money by being \"right.\" ❌ In this episode of The 10 in 10 Podcast, Brent Kleinman reveals why Small Business Law and the Art of Negotiation are the most important skills for any entrepreneur. Whether you need Startup Funding or are planning a Career Pivot, Brent’s 70% Rule is the ultimate roadmap for Small Business success in Phoenix.\n\nIf you are looking for legal advice for small businesses or wondering how to start a restaurant, this interview with Brent Kleinman covers the essentials. We dive deep into Small Business Law, the ethics of AI in Business, and how to win the GCC Innovation Challenge—a \"Shark Tank\" style program helping Phoenix entrepreneurs launch their dreams with over $100,000 in support. Mastering Negotiation and Compromise is the key to surviving the 2026 business landscape.\n\n00:00 Intro: Pete the Pet Guy & Brent Kleinman\n00:25 Brent's Hospitality Roots: Nightclubs & Distribution\n01:25 Choosing Law School: The Career Pivot\n01:40 Practicing Small Business Law for Restaurants\n02:25 The Art of Negotiation: Why 100% Right is Wrong\n02:57 The 70% Rule: Business Survival Guide\n03:40 AI in Business: Interpersonal Skills vs. Automation\n04:40 The GCC Innovation Challenge: Startup Funding\n05:55 Overcoming Public Speaking & Communication\n07:45 Giving Back: Serving Vulnerable Populations in Phoenix\n08:25 Business Success: People, Process, and Profit\n10:05 Connect with Brent Kleinman & GCC Achieve\n\nSmall Business Law basics and Legal Advice.\n\nHow to master Business Negotiation and Compromise.\n\nGetting Startup Funding in Phoenix, Arizona.\n\nCareer Pivot tips from hospitality to professional services.\n\nEntrepreneurship lessons on The 10 in 10 Podcast.\n\nUsing AI in Business ethically to boost productivity.\n\nConnect with Brent Kleinman:\n\nInstagram: @Brent4AZ\n\nGCC Achieve: @GCCAchieve\n\nWebsite: https://www.gccaz.edu\n\n#SmallBusinessLaw #BusinessNegotiation #BrentKleinman #The10in10Podcast #HowToStartABusiness #NegotiationTactics #EntrepreneurshipTips #CareerPivot #GCCInnovationChallenge #StartupFunding #PhoenixBusiness #MaricopaCounty #LeadershipLessons #BusinessEthics #AIinBusiness #SmallBusinessLegalAdvice #HospitalityIndustry #PodcastLane #PeteThePeptideGuy #BusinessStrategy2026 #SuccessMindset #ArizonaEntrepreneurs #BusinessGrowthHacks #WinWinNegotiation #SmallBusinessMentor #LegalSecrets #FounderAdvice #SharkTankArizona #GlendaleCommunityCollege",
