    "guest": "George Pisaruk",
    "publishedAt": "2026-02-05T07:00:12Z",
    "duration": "10:20",
    "description": "In this episode, the conversation takes a closer look at why more businesses are turning to small, highly experienced corporate law firms and fractional General Counsel (GC) services as a smarter alternative to traditional large-firm models. In today’s market, companies need strategic legal guidance that is practical, accessible, and aligned with real business goals—without the cost or complexity of maintaining a full in-house legal department.\n\nGeorge Pisaruk shares how a fractional GC approach allows startups, small, and mid-sized companies to access senior-level legal experience on a flexible, cost-effective basis. With more than 25 years of experience working with private, public, domestic, international, and nonprofit organizations, George explains how proactive legal support can help businesses reduce risk, stay compliant, and make confident decisions as they grow.\n\nThe episode explores how experienced legal counsel supports key areas such as contracts, employment policies, data privacy and cybersecurity, corporate governance, intellectual property, mergers and acquisitions, financing, international expansion, and operational matters. Listeners gain insight into how early legal involvement can prevent costly issues later and create a stronger foundation for long-term success.\n\nGeorge also discusses his passion for helping companies that often believe experienced legal guidance is out of reach. By offering outside general counsel services, he helps business leaders integrate legal strategy into daily operations—positioning their companies for sustainable growth while maintaining financial efficiency.\n\nThis episode is a valuable listen for founders, executives, and leadership teams seeking clarity, protection, and trusted legal partnership in an increasingly complex business landscape.\n\nA Cost-Effective Partner in Your Growth\nPisaruk Legal Solutions is committed to making high-level legal leadership accessible to small and mid-sized businesses that need experienced guidance but don’t require a full-time in-house lawyer. Whether you are a startup building your foundation or an established company navigating growth, transactions, or regulatory complexity, we focus on delivering practical solutions that position your company for long-term success.\nContact Pisaruk Legal Solutions for an initial consultation and discover how we can help your business grow with confidence. \nBuilt for Businesses That Mean Business\nWhether you’re a startup laying the groundwork or an established company entering your next phase of growth, we provide the legal horsepower you need — without the burden of a full-time salary and benefits package.\nSmart companies don’t wait for legal problems. They prevent them.\nLet’s Talk About Your Next Move\n📩 george@pisaruklegal.com\n🌐 www.pisaruklegal.com\n\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
