    "id": "6MtiGFy3saw",
    "title": "10 in 10 Podcast Featuring Jeff Lester Drip &Threads Wear Your Words Build Something That Gives Back",
    "guest": "Jeff Lester",
    "publishedAt": "2026-02-05T07:00:06Z",
    "duration": "10:26",
    "description": "In this episode, the conversation explores the heart and purpose behind Drip & Threads, a streetwear brand rooted in meaning, intention, and quiet impact. Built on simple yet powerful words, Drip & Threads is designed to inspire confidence, clarity, and forward movement—often through subtle messages meant for the wearer first.\n\nThe episode dives into why the brand was created and how words, at the right moment, can change the direction of a life. What began as a personal reminder during challenging seasons became a wearable expression of belief—something authentic, not performative.\n\nListeners will also learn how Drip & Threads gives back through partnerships with local nonprofits and community organizations. Select collections and limited drops support causes close to home, with a focus on children, families, and underserved communities.\n\nThe conversation also highlights the connection between Drip & Threads and Solterra Solutions, both founded by Jeff Lester. While operating in different lanes, both brands are built on the same core values of compassion, trust, and service—proving that purpose can take many forms while always leading from the heart.\n\nDifferent lanes. Same heart.\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
