    "duration": "9:37",
    "description": "With over 36 years of experience in the wellness industry, Leia Ryan is on a mission to help individuals and families create safer, healthier living environments using proven, science-backed technology. Through education and personalized solutions, Leia empowers people to take control of their health by improving the air they breathe, the water they drink, and the homes they live in.\n\nIn this episode of The 10 in 10 with Leia Ryan, we dive into why clean air and water matter more than ever—especially in Arizona, where air quality and environmental exposure can significantly impact long-term health.\nLeia specializes in ActivePure® air purification systems, designed to reduce contaminants and support cleaner indoor air; Hydrogen LivingWater® ionizers, which provide pH-balanced, antioxidant-rich hydration to support detoxification and overall wellness; and LaundryPure®, an innovative system that cleans laundry without hot water or harsh chemical detergents.\nWith SafeAirToday.com, Leia doesn’t just offer products—she provides a path to long-term wellness, helping people reduce chemical exposure, make informed decisions, and build healthier lifestyles tailored to their unique needs.\n\nShare your thoughts in the comments and send this episode to someone focused on wellness, longevity, or clean living.\n\nResources & Links:\n\nFor more information: \nhttps://www.elevateenvironment.com \nAir purification ionized/ hydrogen \nLivingWater| Chemical free LaundryPure \n\nThe 10 in 10 podcast, Leia Ryan, air purification systems, Arizona air quality, water filtration wellness, ActivePure air purifier, Hydrogen LivingWater, LaundryPure system, clean living Arizona, wellness technology podcast\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others. \nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time \n\n#cleanliving #water #filter #cleanair #health #healthwellness",
