    "guest": "Adam Burns",
    "publishedAt": "2026-01-02T05:41:33Z",
    "duration": "12:37",
    "description": "Adam Burns is a Scottsdale-based entrepreneur and 20-year veteran of the medical and wellness industry, dedicated to helping men and women reclaim their energy, confidence, and vitality at every stage of life. As the founder of Modern Therapeutics, Adam created a proactive alternative to the outdated belief that declining performance and low energy are simply “part of aging.”\n\nIn this episode of The 10 in 10 with Adam Burns, Adam shares how his career began in the sexual health and wellness space in 2003 and evolved into a deeper focus on hormone optimization, longevity, and quality-of-life care. His approach centers on education first, personalized treatment, and guideline-based medicine—not one-size-fits-all solutions.\n\nModern Therapeutics is a Scottsdale hormone replacement and wellness clinic serving both men and women, emphasizing informed decision-making, responsible care, and sustainable long-term results. Adam’s mission is simple but powerful: help people live longer, feel better, and stay confident at every age.\n\n What You’ll Learn in This Episode:\n\n• How Adam Burns got started in the health and wellness industry\n • Why he founded Modern Therapeutics and the gap he saw in traditional care\n• What truly sets Modern Therapeutics apart from other hormone clinics\n•How education and personalization lead to better outcomes\n•Adam’s perspective on the recent changes around TRT conversations for women and what it means for patient care\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
    "url": "https://youtu.be/gm_m_AdH3Sk",
    "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gm_m_AdH3Sk/maxresdefault.jpg"
