    "description": "Featuring Jessica Benevento | The Mortgage Matchmaker\n\nJessica Benevento, widely known across Arizona as The Mortgage Matchmaker, is a top-producing mortgage broker based in Scottsdale, Arizona, helping families and entrepreneurs turn homeownership into long-term, generational wealth. Licensed in multiple states, Jessica brings a relationship-first, education-driven approach to mortgage lending, making the process feel clear, empowering, and—yes—possible.\n\nIn this episode of The 10 in 10 with Jessica Benevento, Jessica shares her journey into the mortgage industry, how she created the nickname Mortgage Matchmaker, and what buyers and agents need to understand about today’s housing market—especially in Arizona’s ever-changing real estate landscape.\n\nBeyond the numbers, Jessica is a true community builder. She leads multiple networking groups, mentors entrepreneurs, hosts Local Legends, and serves on the board of Village of the Valley, a nonprofit supporting women healing from abuse. Whether she’s structuring creative loan solutions or spotlighting Arizona’s local leaders, her mission is simple: open doors, create opportunity, and make big dreams feel achievable.\n\nWhen she’s not working with buyers and real estate partners, you’ll find her with her husband and kids, cheering at a baseball field, or creating content that blends humor, heart, and real talk about mortgages and the housing market.\n\n What You’ll Learn in This Episode:\n\n• What being the Mortgage Matchmaker really means—and how Jessica found her purpose in helping people buy homes\n•The #1 thing buyers don’t realize in today’s market (but absolutely should)\n•What sets Jessica apart from other mortgage professionals\n•Why relationships and education matter more than rates alone\n•How community involvement fuels long-term success\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone thinking about buying, selling, or refinancing.\n\nThe 10 in 10 podcast, Jessica Benevento, Mortgage Matchmaker, Arizona mortgage broker, Scottsdale mortgage lender, Arizona real estate podcast, home buying tips Arizona, generational wealth through real estate, women in real estate leadership\n\nJoin the conversation in the comments and share this episode with someone ready to rethink marketing, life, business, community or what’s making a difference for others.\n\nThe Podcast Lane ~ Connecting People One Podcast at a Time",
