    "description": "🎙️ 10 in 10 Podcast | Featuring Cheryl Scheidell — Understanding Reverse Mortgages 🏡\nHosted by Ashley Clark\n\nWhat are the real basics of a Reverse Mortgage, and why can it be such a powerful option for seniors—even for those looking to purchase a home?\nWhat’s the biggest myth people still believe about Reverse Mortgages?\nAnd what if you already have one of those really low interest rates — can you still benefit from a Reverse Mortgage?\n\nIn this insightful episode, Ashley Clark sits down with Cheryl Scheidell of Barrett Financial, who brings over 20 years in the mortgage industry and a decade of Reverse Mortgage expertise. Cheryl believes in these programs so much — her own mom has one!\n\nA native Phoenician and NAU graduate, Cheryl has built her career on education, trust, and community impact. She’s the Co-Founder of Arizona Women of Impact, has chaired the ValleyLife Gala, and continues to be a passionate advocate for empowering seniors through financial freedom.\n\nWhen she’s not helping clients across AZ, OR, CA, NV, TX, and nationwide (except NY), Cheryl loves to travel, having visited all 50 states before turning 50, and is now setting her sights on Ireland, Scotland, and Bora Bora.\n\n✨ Tune in to learn how Reverse Mortgages can provide security, flexibility, and peace of mind — and why Cheryl’s mission is to be a trusted resource to her community.\n\n👉 Subscribe for more 10-minute conversations that educate, inspire, and empower.\n#10in10Podcast #ReverseMortgage #CherylScheidell #AshleyClark #SeniorLiving #MortgageEducation #HomeEquity #FinancialFreedom #BarrettFinancial",
